flowchart LR
    Visitor["Player or maker"] --> Browser["Playtrace browser app<br/>GitHub Pages"]
    Browser -->|"Browse history; read and contribute<br/>public feedback without login"| API["Cloudflare Worker<br/>Public and authenticated API"]
    Browser -->|"Optional sign-in for private follows"| Clerk["Clerk<br/>Neorgon accounts"]
    Clerk -->|"Signed session token"| Browser
    API -->|"Pinned public signing keys"| Clerk
    API -->|"Games, source posts, public feedback,<br/>private follows/prices, quotas and tombstones"| D1[("Cloudflare D1")]
    Browser -->|"Original previews and post links"| Sources["Creator media hosts<br/>and Reddit posts"]
    Cron["Hourly schedule"] --> Collector["Recent updates + historical pass<br/>from December 2022"]
    Collector -->|"Bounded, paced requests"| Archive["Arctic Shift archive<br/>r/aigamedev"]
    Collector -->|"Source-described games,<br/>review candidates and coverage"| D1
    Operator["Operator with separate credential"] -->|"Review, import, moderate, remove;<br/>approve image permission"| API
    API -->|"Validated creator-approved images"| R2[("Private R2 preview bucket")]
    API -->|"Checked media response"| Browser
